    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planet Catalogue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>over 300 unique planets</strong> to complete a premade catalog. But the collection doesn't stop there. Make the universe truly yours by adding <strong>YOUR OWN PLANETS</strong>\u2014<strong>simply use your own images</strong> to seamlessly integrate them into the procedural generation pool for you to find on future voyages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/66744d22d7bfbd21b2203207d1ab306b.poster.avif?t=1754140503\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/66744d22d7bfbd21b2203207d1ab306b.webm?t=1754140503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/66744d22d7bfbd21b2203207d1ab306b.mp4?t=1754140503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Active &amp; Passive Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Exploration:</strong> Set a destination and engage the autopilot. Your ship will navigate the cosmos automatically, creating a perfect ambient backdrop while you work, study, or relax.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Travel:</strong>\u00a0Take manual control to pilot through asteroid fields, collect powerups, and reach your destination faster.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/6a45c25d6057195b36b215e155217377.poster.avif?t=1754140503\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/6a45c25d6057195b36b215e155217377.webm?t=1754140503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/6a45c25d6057195b36b215e155217377.mp4?t=1754140503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Perfect Desktop Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pocket Universe runs as a transparent overlay, turning any part of your screen into a stunning view of  star systems. Freely resize and place it anywhere to create the perfect cosmic backdrop while you work, study, or relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/14dda973782a3d2507488c58112eb742.poster.avif?t=1754140503\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/14dda973782a3d2507488c58112eb742.webm?t=1754140503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/14dda973782a3d2507488c58112eb742.mp4?t=1754140503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your OWN Star System</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your library of discovered and created planets to design personalized star systems from scratch. Hand-pick the central star, place planets in any orbit, customize their size, and adorn them with rings and moons to craft your perfect stellar neighborhood.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/2ba516fd1ba1b58068ee307c9fb69509.poster.avif?t=1754140503\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/2ba516fd1ba1b58068ee307c9fb69509.webm?t=1754140503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/2ba516fd1ba1b58068ee307c9fb69509.mp4?t=1754140503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOSPAN IS WAITING FOR YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/416aa7d83a9c1213c5f4c386b416f253.poster.avif?t=1754140503\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795550/extras/416aa7d83a9c1213c5f4c386b416f253.webm?t=1754140503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
